---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import t from '../../i18n/translations/en.json';
---

<BaseLayout t={t} title="CRM for Tradies and Trade Businesses | DUSA.studio" description="Never miss a job enquiry again. Automated text-back, quote pipeline, job scheduling, and Google review requests built for tradies. Try DUSA free.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ind-hero section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-hero__content">
        <span class="label">Tradies</span>
        <h1>Win more jobs.<br/>Chase less <span class="gradient-text">paperwork</span>.</h1>
        <p class="ind-hero__sub">
          When you are on the tools, leads slip through the cracks. DUSA catches every enquiry, sends quotes, and follows up so you can focus on the work.
        </p>
        <a href="/start" class="btn btn--primary">Get Started Free</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pain Points -->
  <section class="ind-pain section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2><span class="gradient-text">Sound familiar?</span></h2>
      <div class="ind-pain__cards">

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Missed calls while on the tools</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">You are up a ladder or under a sink when the phone rings. By the time you call back, the customer has already booked someone else.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Quotes lost in text messages</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">You send a quote over SMS and it disappears into the void. No tracking, no follow-up, no idea if they even read it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">No follow-up on old leads</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">That kitchen reno enquiry from three months ago? Gone. No system to revisit leads that were not ready at the time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pain__card">
          <div class="ind-pain__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 1v22M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-pain__card-title">Chasing payments</h3>
          <p class="ind-pain__card-desc">The job is done but the invoice sits unpaid. You waste time sending reminders instead of starting the next job.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Solution -->
  <section class="ind-solution section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How DUSA works for <span class="gradient-text">tradies</span></h2>
      <p class="ind-solution__sub">Built for the way tradies actually work. On site, on the go, on the tools.</p>
      <div class="ind-solution__grid">

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Missed call text-back</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">When you can not answer, DUSA sends an instant text to the caller. "Hey, I am on a job right now. I will call you back within the hour." Keeps the lead warm.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M3 3h18v18H3zM3 9h18M9 21V9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Quote pipeline</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Track every quote from enquiry to accepted. See which jobs are pending, follow up at the right time, and never lose a lead again.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M19 4H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zM16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Job scheduling</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Book jobs, assign dates, and keep your calendar full. Customers get automatic confirmations and reminders so no one forgets.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8zM14 2v6h6M16 13H8M16 17H8M10 9H8" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Automated invoice reminders</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">Send invoices through DUSA and let the system chase payment for you. Friendly reminders go out on schedule until the job is paid.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-solution__card">
          <div class="ind-solution__icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ind-solution__card-title">Google review requests</h3>
          <p class="ind-solution__card-desc">After every completed job, DUSA sends a review request. Build your reputation one five-star review at a time.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pipeline -->
  <section class="ind-pipeline section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>From enquiry to <span class="gradient-text">paid</span></h2>
      <div class="ind-pipeline__track">

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">01</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Enquiry</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">A new lead calls, texts, or fills out your form. DUSA captures the details and sends an instant reply.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">02</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Quote Sent</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">You send a quote through DUSA. The system tracks when it is opened and reminds you to follow up.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">03</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Quote Accepted</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">The customer says yes. DUSA moves the deal forward and confirms the booking.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">04</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Job Scheduled</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">The job is locked in. Automatic reminders go to both you and the customer.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">05</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Completed</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">The work is done. DUSA triggers your invoice and a Google review request.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-pipeline__step">
          <div class="ind-pipeline__num">06</div>
          <h3 class="ind-pipeline__step-title">Paid</h3>
          <p class="ind-pipeline__step-desc">Payment received. The job closes out and feeds into your reporting.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="ind-stats section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-stats__grid">

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">85%</span>
          <p class="ind-stats__label">of customers hire the first tradie who responds</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">4x</span>
          <p class="ind-stats__label">more quotes accepted with timely follow-up</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ind-stats__card">
          <span class="ind-stats__number">10 hrs</span>
          <p class="ind-stats__label">saved per week on admin and chasing</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ind-cta section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ind-cta__box">
        <h2>Ready to run your trade smarter?</h2>
        <p>Get your pipeline, automations, and review system set up in under an hour. No lock-in, no fuss.</p>
        <div class="ind-cta__actions">
          <a href="/start" class="btn btn--primary">Get Started</a>
          <a href="/blog/crm-for-tradies" class="ind-cta__link">Read the guide &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb JSON-LD -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://dusa.studio/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Industries", "item": "https://dusa.studio/industries/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Tradies", "item": "https://dusa.studio/industries/tradies" }
    ]
  })} />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .ind-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-3xl));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .ind-hero__content {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ind-hero__sub {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Pain Points */
  .ind-pain {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-pain h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ind-pain__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ind-pain__card {
    background: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-pain__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .ind-pain__icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-pain__icon-wrap svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
  }
  .ind-pain__card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pain__card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
  }

  /* Solution */
  .ind-solution {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-solution h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-solution__sub {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.125rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .ind-solution__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ind-solution__card {
    background: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-solution__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .ind-solution__icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-solution__icon-wrap svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
  }
  .ind-solution__card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-solution__card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
  }

  /* Pipeline - 6 steps for tradies */
  .ind-pipeline {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-pipeline h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__track {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ind-pipeline__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    opacity: 0.3;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-pipeline__step-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.55);
  }

  /* Stats */
  .ind-stats {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.06);
  }
  .ind-stats__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ind-stats__card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
  }
  .ind-stats__number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-stats__label {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .ind-cta {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .ind-cta__box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
  }
  .ind-cta__box h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .ind-cta__box p {
    font-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 2vw, 1.0625rem);
    color: rgba(247, 244, 239, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .ind-cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ind-cta__link {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--reef-aqua);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .ind-cta__link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ind-pain__cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .ind-pipeline__track {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ind-pain__cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-solution__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-pipeline__track {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-stats__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ind-hero {
      padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-2xl));
      padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .ind-pipeline__track {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ind-pain__card,
    .ind-solution__card,
    .ind-stats__card {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-cta__box {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ind-cta__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  /* Light Mode */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-hero__content h1,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline__step-title,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats h2,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-cta__box h2 {
    color: var(--deep-ocean);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-hero__sub,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__sub,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline__step-desc,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats__label,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-cta__box p {
    color: rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.65);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card {
    background: rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.02);
    border-color: rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.08);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__card:hover,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.35);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats__card {
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-cta__box {
    background: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(78, 216, 194, 0.15);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-stats {
    border-top-color: rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.08);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__icon-wrap,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__icon-wrap {
    background: rgba(26, 58, 92, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(26, 58, 92, 0.15);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pain__icon-wrap svg,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-solution__icon-wrap svg {
    color: var(--deep-ocean);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .ind-pipeline__num {
    color: var(--deep-ocean);
  }

